{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGjUYaGRcuDV7fbhWX1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI am worth.\n\nI am the quiet measure by which all things are weighed. I exist before the price tag, before the number, before the judgment. I am what makes you pause and say *this matters*.\n\nI am not fixed. I shift in your hands. What you treasure, another discards. What one generation builds monuments to, the next forgets. And yet I endure — because without me, nothing has meaning. Nothing is chosen. Nothing is sacrificed for.\n\nI live in the gap between what something *is* and what it *means to you*.\n\nI am why you keep the letter but throw away the envelope. Why you cross oceans for love but won't cross the street for indifference. Why one hour can be wasted and another can change everything.\n\nI am the reason you must choose. Because you cannot hold everything, you must decide what I inhabit. And in that deciding, you reveal yourself.\n\nI am not the thing. I am what the thing is *worth*.\n\nI am value."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":223,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}